#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. モノクマじゃなくて、テレビでも見られたらな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on. I'd\n"
"much rather be able to watch regular TV...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. きっと今も、この向こうで…黒幕が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even now, the mastermind is probably on the other side\n"
"of that surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう思うとムカツクけど、放っておくしかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Just thinking about it puts me on edge...but there's\n"
"nothing I can really do about it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>最近、あんまり時計を見なくなった。
#. 意味がないってわかったからかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't look at the clock too much these days. I mean,\n"
"what's the point?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これも慣れってヤツか、
#. なんだか虚しいな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I guess this is me getting used to being here, huh?\n"
"It's a pretty empty feeling...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここにも鉄板か…
#. 開いている窓には期待出来ないのかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yet another metal plate. I guess I shouldn't expect to\n"
"find an open window anywhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここにも鉄板か…
#. 開いている窓には期待出来ないのかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yet another metal plate. I guess I shouldn't expect to\n"
"find an open window anywhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0008 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0009 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0012 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
